OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust's mental health service
OL,4,Aimproves rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS mental health service which was
OL,7,Ftold it required improvement by a
OL,8,Fwatchdog has now been rated as "good".
OL,10,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,11,Fvisited Avon and Wiltshire Mental
OL,12,FHealth Partnership NHS Trust (AWP) to
OL,13,Finspect its specialist mental health
OL,14,Fservice in June after it found breaches
OL,15,Fin regulations in 2021.
OL,17,FAccording to a report, the breaches
OL,18,Fwithin the AWP's children and adult
OL,19,Fmental health service (CAMHS) in
OL,20,F2021included risk assessments, waiting
OL,21,Flists, safe staffing levels and
OL,22,Fenvironmental.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
